            "title": "Duração",
            "text": "Um ataque."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "title": "Description",
            "text": "Aims and fires or throws as though the target were motionless."
          },
          {
            "title": "Requirements",
            "text": "Celerity 4 and Auspex 2."
          },
          {
            "title": "Cost",
            "text": "One Rouse Check."
          },
          {
            "title": "System",
            "text": "Activate before a ranged attack. The target makes no defense or dodge roll; attack at Difficulty 1. An opponent with Celerity 5 can negate this with their own Rouse Check and defend normally."
